      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i was looking at my student loan statement and i'm kinda confused. i see how much i'm paying every month, but the actual principal balance barely seems to go down. why does it feel like the interest is eating up all my payments? can you explain how the math actually works on a declining balance?",
